,[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"k\\frac{8q}{9d^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"k\\frac{10q}{9d^{2}}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-a9-xiezuoti-fanxiaokao-2408-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-a9-xiezuoti-fanxiaokao-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-a9-xiezuoti-fanxiaokao-2408-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","电学","热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6f1fa8cdc078da12d20950bc15c2977a3fcc5d459ec0e502c687042cd9cb1285","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 下列说法正确的是\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 在一定条件下，晶体和非晶体可以互相转化"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 牛顿运动定律不适用，则动量守恒定律也不适用"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 电磁场是真实存在的物质，电磁波具有动量和能量"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 当波源与观察者相互接近时，观察者观测到波的频率小于波源振动的频率"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-a9-xiezuoti-fanxiaokao-2408-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-a9-xiezuoti-fanxiaokao-2408","source_question_id":"gaosan-a9-xiezuoti-fanxiaokao-2408-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c905bb7978ef79280da8c8baf5c2bab2f851b85ab457cc2f63594b3a7e3a08cb","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. 内燃机、通风机等在排放各种高速气流的过程中都会发出噪声，如图所示的消声器可以用来削弱高速气流产生的噪声。波长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":" 的声波沿水平管道自左向右传播，在声波到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 处时，分成上、下两束波，这两束声波在 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 处相遇时可削弱噪声。已知上、下两束波从 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 处到 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的路程分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"s_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"s_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d05c76babe2fa8993c088d0cfe73d260d01e2b4d8c734fb7973bdf4966303b72.png","width":416,"height":248,"width_mm":48.86,"row_group":"gaosan-a9-